  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Esto... ¿Te importaría ayudarme?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074006F002E002E002E002000BF0054006500200069006D0070006F007200740061007200ED00610020006100790075006400610072006D0065003F00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es que dentro de nada tengo una cita con\nuna chica a la que le gustan los Purrloin...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Purrr...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500075007200720072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero estoy tan nervioso que sé que no me van a\nsalir las palabras.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F0020006500730074006F0079002000740061006E0020006E0065007200760069006F0073006F00200071007500650020007300E900200071007500650020006E006F0020006D0065002000760061006E00200061000A00730061006C006900720020006C00610073002000700061006C00610062007200610073002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ayúdame a mantener una conversación con ella!\nPor favor, ¡te lo ruego!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ven a hablar conmigo cuando estés preparad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.\nDe verdad que lo necesito.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Purrr...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500075007200720072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Estás list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa para ayudarme?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00450073007400E100730020006C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F0061002000700061007200610020006100790075006400610072006D0065003F00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Yo me encargo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059006F0020006D006500200065006E0063006100720067006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Todavía no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00640061007600ED00610020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si puedes, te agradecería que me echaras\nuna mano, que voy a reventar de los nervios.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gra-gracias.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061002D0067007200610063006900610073002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A ella le encantan los Purrloin, así que atrapé uno\nhace nada. Pero claro, no lo conozco apenas.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puuur...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500075007500750072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hazme el favor de sentarte cerca de mí y ayúdame\nsi ves que estoy en apuros.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Debe de estar a punto de llegar...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi ves que me hace alguna pregunta y no tengo\nni idea de qué responder, chívame algo bueno.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué cafetería y qué Purrloin tan preciosos!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi añadimos una buena conversación, ¡tendremos\ntodos los ingredientes para pasar un buen rato!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Supongo que sabrás a qué categoría pertenece\ntu Purrloin, ¿verdad?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300750070006F006E0067006F00200071007500650020007300610062007200E100730020006100200071007500E9002000630061007400650067006F007200ED0061002000700065007200740065006E006500630065000A0074007500200050007500720072006C006F0069006E002C002000BF007600650072006400610064003F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon Malicioso",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020004D0061006C006900630069006F0073006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon Calculador",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000430061006C00630075006C00610064006F00720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon Intimidación",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200049006E00740069006D0069006400610063006900F3006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Justo! \"Malicioso\" es la palabra que describe\na la perfección a un Purrloin.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno... Esa no es exactamente su categoría.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750065006E006F002E002E002E00200045007300610020006E006F0020006500730020006500780061006300740061006D0065006E00740065002000730075002000630061007400650067006F007200ED0061002E00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me hizo mucha gracia cuando me enteré de por\nqué los Purrloin roban a las personas.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSupongo que estarás al tanto, ¿no?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por supervivencia",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00720020007300750070006500720076006900760065006E0063006900610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por diversión",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00720020006400690076006500720073006900F3006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Porque odian a los Entrenadores",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00720071007500650020006F006400690061006E002000610020006C006F007300200045006E007400720065006E00610064006F0072006500730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Has dado en el clavo! Les da vidilla en su día\na día; si no, se aburrirían de lo lindo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿De dónde has sacado eso? Purrloin es más bien\ndespreocupado, diría yo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tengo una buena pregunta para ti: ¿sabes qué\nmovimiento no le puedes enseñar a un Purrloin?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tormento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F0072006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maquinación",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061007100750069006E00610063006900F3006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Juego Sucio",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A007500650067006F00200053007500630069006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Di que sí! Quién diría que no lo puede aprender...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10044006900200071007500650020007300ED0021002000510075006900E9006E002000640069007200ED006100200071007500650020006E006F0020006C006F00200070007500650064006500200061007000720065006E006400650072002E002E002E00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, yo diría que sí que pueden usar ese\nmovimiento...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750065006E006F002C00200079006F002000640069007200ED006100200071007500650020007300ED0020007100750065002000700075006500640065006E002000750073006100720020006500730065000A006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F002E002E002E00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Purr...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007500720072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué divertido es hablar con otro amante de\nlos Purrloin! Me lo he pasado pipa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pu-pues... Creo que le caes muy bien a\nmi Purrloin...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500075002D0070007500650073002E002E002E0020004300720065006F00200071007500650020006C0065002000630061006500730020006D007500790020006200690065006E00200061000A006D006900200050007500720072006C006F0069006E002E002E002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Purr...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007500720072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y a mí también me... has caído... muy bien...\nSi quieres, podemos volver a vernos.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te lo agradezco, pero me habría gustado que\nconocieras mejor a los Purrloin. ¡Lo siento!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Al pobre se le ha caído el mundo encima...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C00200070006F0062007200650020007300650020006C006500200068006100200063006100ED0064006F00200065006C0020006D0075006E0064006F00200065006E00630069006D0061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cuando quieras podemos volver a hablar de\nlos Purrloin! Nunca me canso.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "♪¡Purrr!♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "266A00A1005000750072007200720021266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mu-muchas gracias... Espera un momento,\nahora mismo vuelvo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075002D006D0075006300680061007300200067007200610063006900610073002E002E002E002000450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002C000A00610068006F007200610020006D00690073006D006F0020007600750065006C0076006F002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchas gracias por echarme un cable. Si no llega\na ser por ti, no habría dado ni una.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ha accedido a que nos veamos de nuevo!\nNo sabes cuánto te lo agradezco...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El caso es que... la quiero acompañar, pero ¿qué\nharé si vuelve a sacar algún tema sobre Purrloin?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 5860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si sigo nervioso y saca ciertos temas, intentaré\npreguntarle qué cosas le gustan y aprovecharé<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npara dejarme conocer poco a poco.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 5872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Purrr...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500075007200720072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si veo que se pone nervioso, sacaré algún tema\nrelacionado con Purrloin. ¡Es que son preciosos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    }
  ],
